    <string name="sobre_titulo_app">What the app does</string>
    <string name="sobre_descricao">Tool Organizer is an app for managing the tool collection of a workshop. With it you can register a tool by entering its name, code/serial number, location, category and condition, as well as stating whether it is available for lending. The registered tools are shown in a list, where a tap on an item displays a summary of its data. Long pressing an item opens the contextual action menu, with the options to edit and delete the tool. The settings screen lets you choose how the list is sorted and which values are suggested on every new registration.</string>
